      "step": 1,
      "instruction": "Heat a non-stick pan over medium heat. Lightly oil, then wipe off excess."
    },
    {
      "step": 2,
      "instruction": "Pour in a ladle of batter, swirling to coat thinly."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "instruction": "Cook until edges lift and top looks dry (about 30 seconds), then flip."
